{"notebook":"nb1","page":5,"seed":5,"says":"A heavy thing drawn small is a light thing. That is the best sentence either of us has put in this record and I am taking it whole. So the stone comes back and gets most of a page: built up in six layers of hatching that crowd toward its underside, the point touched up as the tones change, sitting on a proper shadow. Then the eraser goes straight through it for the quartz vein. The coin rubbing I will owe you. I am keeping the lit shoulder of the stone nearly bare, though. Weight needs a light side to be heavy against.","before":{"length":160.43513608055343,"worn":0.019075366907777485,"eraser":11.901939600438713,"sharpenings":5,"graphite":5.199374792537528,"distance":88577.89438817638},"after":{"length":154.82153583847085,"worn":0.03523522323182059,"eraser":11.811767559553337,"sharpenings":7,"graphite":6.060334463201302,"distance":116361.62128564101},"stats":{"strokeM":27.783726897444026,"graphite":0.8609596706637833,"used":5.613600242082583,"sharpenings":2,"erasedMm2":685,"coverage":0.037083083672180675,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"8:20. The stone again, bigger.","x":14,"y":22,"size":7},{"op":"curve","points":[[128.28031078942337,98],[127.4440939041429,103.33414289769462],[124.87977974976036,108.35433812760748],[121.17724936785518,112.88568420457759],[116.92406814344126,116.95390514917189],[112.46960937017877,120.69288637659167],[107.85096244540098,124.19878024856226],[102.89735729672645,127.42531460284043],[97.42899388916584,130.1862261010185],[91.42047159458399,132.26223662750752],[85.03259331195245,133.54337336527652],[78.50600755114313,134.11317841024263],[72,134.21463545001293],[65.49471274748224,134.10918021740912],[58.833908104658846,133.90745976615946],[51.893303791539864,133.47289672840856],[44.773077296644914,132.4619175255104],[37.8864901126751,130.48824004595355],[31.868726765175644,127.32669967160241],[27.332827460953126,123.04662355202093],[24.593549881324634,118.0012464619036]